    99-100 %, CPU fan 1 540-2 181 RPM, memory 84 469-85 389 MB, on-glass clock
    00:25:16 to 00:25:28 with 12 distinct seconds.  New switches: --live-seconds
    N samples the box once a second, --record FILE writes what it read next to
    the video, --series FILE makes six files show the same minute.  That file's
    own source note says what the bench was doing, including that the sampler
